  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Calls for a common EU definition and classification of smart autonomous robots, with a registration system.",
   "Proposes an EU Agency for Robotics and AI to provide technical, ethical and regulatory expertise.",
   "Recommends a strict liability or risk-management approach plus compulsory insurance and a compensation fund; considers a specific legal status of 'electronic persons' in the long term.",
